      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## Filter in the page\n\nThe list is already in the tree. On `input` of `#q`, hide `li` nodes whose text does not include the query (case-insensitive). Use a class or `hidden` — do not rebuild innerHTML from a string of names."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "hide-not-rebuild",
      "promptMd": "The honest filter…",
      "kind": "mcq",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "html",
          "md": "Writes a new innerHTML string of the matches"
        },
        {
          "id": "nodes",
          "md": "Shows/hides existing `li` nodes"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "nodes"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
